      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get what you're saying about a doctor but i just dont have the time to go to the clinic right now. it's really just a burning sensation and it goes away when i rest so i dont think its anything massive. if i take a double dose of Tums or maybe some extra strength Pepcid, would that be safe to do just to get through the week? i dont want to keep feeling this way every time i move around.",
